(% class="legend-box" %)
**Legend:** (% style="color:#f1c40f" %)🏆 Best-in-slot(%%) · (% style="color:#7fdbff" %)⭐ Strong endgame(%%) · (% style="color:#b39ddb" %)🟣 Rare/Ex(%%) · (% style="color:#fff176" %)🟡 Rare(%%) · (% style="color:#81c784" %)🟢 Charm-only piece(%%) · Links go to **bg-wiki.com**.

(% class="legend-box" %)
**BST runs multiple sets.** Charm-only (max **CHR**), TP/melee (Acc/Att), and optional MP-recovery and STR-WS sets. CHR is the **only** stat that improves charm success — stack it for any high-level charm. Galka especially want to shore up CHR.

{{toc/}}

----

= Trust Recommendations =

You solo DPS — Call Beast / Charm / Sic / Reward. With trusts you get a full party that replaces the pet sink in most content.

{{html clean="false"}}
<table class="gt">
<thead><tr><th style="width:60px;">Slot</th><th style="width:200px;">Trust</th><th>Why</th></tr></thead>
<tbody>
<tr><td class="lv">1</td><td>🛡️ <strong><a href="https://www.bg-wiki.com/ffxi/August">August</a></strong></td><td>Tank — BST without Charm has no damage sink, needs hate magnet</td></tr>
<tr><td class="lv">2</td><td>✨ <strong><a href="https://www.bg-wiki.com/ffxi/Apururu_(UC)">Apururu UC</a></strong></td><td>Healer with Haste on melee, full status removal, Convert</td></tr>
<tr><td class="lv">3</td><td>🔮 <strong><a href="https://www.bg-wiki.com/ffxi/Koru-Moru">Koru-Moru</a></strong></td><td>Refresh (Familiar/Reward eat MP), Haste, debuffs</td></tr>
<tr><td class="lv">4</td><td>🎵 <strong><a href="https://www.bg-wiki.com/ffxi/Joachim">Joachim</a></strong></td><td>March + Madrigal boost your axe throws / melee</td></tr>
<tr><td class="lv">5</td><td>⚔️ <strong><a href="https://www.bg-wiki.com/ffxi/Zeid_II">Zeid II</a></strong></td><td>DPS + 4 stun interrupts</td></tr>
</tbody>
</table>
{{/html}}

