== Ranged / Ammo ==

(% class="legend-box" %)
Ammo slot is usually **Pet Food** or **Jug Pets**. Ranged slot defaults to Lightning Bow / Tiphia Sting / Bibiki Seashell depending on stat priority.

{{html clean="false"}}
<table class="gt">
<thead><tr><th class="lv">Lv</th><th>Item</th><th>Notes</th></tr></thead>
<tbody>
