----

= 🐾 Charm Set (Maximize CHR) =

(% class="legend-box" %)
**The whole point of BST is charm.** Stack CHR for any high-level mob. Charm's success is **CHR-only** — Att/Acc gear is dead weight here.

{{html clean="false"}}
<table class="gt">
<thead><tr><th style="width:140px;">Slot</th><th>Best Picks (CHR-focused)</th></tr></thead>
<tbody>
<tr><td><strong>Sub</strong></td><td>Storm Shield (CHR +5)</td></tr>
<tr><td><strong>Head</strong></td><td>**Anwig Salade** (augmentable CHR/Charm) → Bison Warbonnet → Storm Turban → Alluring Headband (mid)</td></tr>
<tr><td><strong>Neck</strong></td><td>Storm Gorget · Shepherd's Chain · **Bird/Beast/Dhalmel Whistle** (mob-specific)</td></tr>
<tr><td><strong>Body</strong></td><td>Bison Jacket · Beast Jackcoat +1 · Gaudy Harness</td></tr>
<tr><td><strong>Hands</strong></td><td>Beast Gloves (AF — Charm gambit) · Bison Wristbands</td></tr>
<tr><td><strong>Legs</strong></td><td>Bison Kecks · Frog Trousers (mid)</td></tr>
